"JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"0a328aaf-6282-494f-beb5-cf5f0947b81b","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351532012,"PostDateInt":1770364428000,"PostDate":"2026-02-06T15:53:48","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"数控算法高级工程师","OrgId":75990,"Org":"机床产品开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.担任数控系统运动控制算法高级工程师,负责高速高精数控算法的探索、研究、开发和维护,解决机床领域各类性能攻关问题;\r\n2.承接NGC平台项目自主化五轴RTCP技术开发及落地,实现全面对标西门子的五轴数控技术","Require":"1.硕士及以上学历，机械电子、自动化、计算机、数学等相关专业；8年以上数控系统、机器人控制或五轴加工算法开发经验或优秀应届博士。\r\n2.掌握五轴加工几何原理（刀轴矢量控制、RTCP功能、后置处理）；熟悉经典/现代控制理论（PID、前馈控制、自适应控制）加分项。\r\n3.熟练掌握MATLAB/Python等进行算法仿真与验证；熟练使用C/C++实现实时控制算法，CNC相关开发经验5年以上。\r\n4.扎实的数学功底及数学建模能力，具备轨迹参数化（弧长参数化、样条插值）能力；熟悉高精度标定技术（激光跟踪仪、球杆仪使用经验优先）；了解模态分析工具者加分。\r\n5.良好的自我驱动与自我学习能力，良好的沟通能力和分析解决问题能力，良好的系统思维能力和团队协作精神，结果导向，对技术工作有强烈的意愿，乐于接受挑战，敢于追求卓越。\r\n6.具备技术文档撰写能力，有专利或论文发表者优先，有CNC系统或工业机器人运动控制研发背景者优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-02-06T15:53:48","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"e33bdeff-2b81-470e-9b09-a7981ddf2a48","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351532010,"PostDateInt":1770364388000,"PostDate":"2026-02-06T15:53:08","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"控制硬件高级工程师","OrgId":86469,"Org":"机器人与智能系统硬件开发模块","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、工业机器人产品的逆变驱动功率硬件设计及产品开发工作，如AC220/AC380电源、整流，20KW以下逆变；\r\n2、负责上述硬件产品的硬件自测，解决自测问题、EMC/UL实验问题处理和市场反馈的硬件相关问题；\r\n3、启动和协调产品结构设计、试制、中试及制造，并推进解决相关制程问题；\r\n4、编写项目及设计文档、质量记录以及其他有关文档；\r\n5、硬件团队建设，硬件技术攻关。","Require":"1.本科及以上学历，自动控制、电力电子或机电相关专业毕业，8年及以上硬件开发工作经验； \n2. 熟悉硬件开发技能，熟悉IGBT、IPM等功率器件的应用；掌握硬件相关专业知识和业务流程，有良好的开发习惯；\n3. 有较丰富的EMC、安规相关知识和问题处理经验；\n4. 工作严谨细致，有责任心；动手能力强，勤奋踏实，善于思考，有独立工作能力；有良好沟通能力，具备团队合作精神。\n5. 熟练使用PADS或EE或AD等EDA工具；深圳控制硬件（机器人、CNC、PLC、HMI、IOT等）。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-02-06T15:53:08","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"592b702a-0364-49d3-a483-b1f4b00728e0","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351532003,"PostDateInt":1770364237000,"PostDate":"2026-02-06T15:50:37","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"应用开发工程师","OrgId":75990,"Org":"机床产品开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["湖北省·武汉市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、负责激光切割工艺的开发、调试及持续改进，包括激光器参数优化、切割头选型及机床特性适配；\r\n2、参与新产品导入，设计工艺方案、规划测试流程（如设备、环境、人员配置）；\r\n3、持续分析加工工艺问题，协同机械、电气等，从工艺维度持续提供激光数控系统的设计改善方案/建议；\r\n4、研究和探索激光新加工工艺，前置储备新工艺技术，提升工艺竞争力;\r\n5、参与激光切割头应用测试，提供改善建议及优化方向。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，激光、物理、材料、光学、机械工程自动化等相关专业；\r\n2、具备3年及以上激光切割工艺经验，熟悉高功率激光器应用及参数调试，熟练使用激光切割软件、设计软件及办公软件；\r\n3、对激光平面切割、坡口切割有调试经验，熟悉激光切割整套配置方案，对CNC、切割头、激光器、调高等各个部件的工作原理有深入认知；\r\n4、了解与数控系统相关的运动控制原理，具备调试数控系统的能力;\r\n5、对Lantek/CNCKAD/柏楚等CAM熟练使用，对后处理更改要求经验丰富者优先；\r\n6、善于分析、总结，具备钻研精神，有较强的沟通协调能力，团结协作意识强。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-02-06T15:50:37","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"c24af21b-136a-44c0-b174-5d32f7ddc6da","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":351531998,"PostDateInt":1770364103000,"PostDate":"2026-02-06T15:48:23","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"机器人算法工程师","OrgId":75985,"Org":"工业机器人产品开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·南京市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.负责调研、跟踪工业界和学术界机器人技术发展趋势并判断技术发展方向，负责工业机器人和协作机器人的技术路线规划和架构设计工作；\r\n2.负责机器人运动控制关键技术和前沿算法的规划、研究与开发，识别当前机器人产品和算法平台的设计缺陷和性能提升点，指导机器人相关运动控制技术的研究与开发，包括但不限于轨迹精度、绝对精度、振动抑制、故障诊断、智能控制等；\r\n3.承担机器人产品系统工程师职责，从系统方案层次权衡考虑产品的性能、成本、质量和研发投入，将专业人士凝聚在一起，主导解决产品开发过程中的复杂系统问题，打造出极致行业竞争力的机器人产品；","Require":"1.机器人、自动化控制、机械电子、控制工程、电气工程、力学等相关专业硕士以上学历，硕士学历7年以上相关工作经验，博士学历3年以上工作经验，博士优先；\r\n2.熟悉业内技术现状及发展方向，熟悉机器人系统架构及运动控制关键技术，精通机器人某几项关键技术，如轨迹精度、绝对精度、振动抑制、动力学建模与辨识、高级伺服控制算法；\r\n3.复合型人才，具备机器人系统分析能力，熟悉机器人性能与结构及硬件设计方案的关系，熟悉伺服控制技术，了解伺服电机、伺服驱动器、减速机等核心传动部件的性能指标，具备分析解决机器人复杂系统问题的能力；\r\n4.良好的自我驱动与自我学习能力，良好的系统思维能力和团队协作精神，结果导向，对技术工作有强烈的意愿，乐于接受挑战，敢于追求卓越；\r\n5.良好的沟通协调能力和分析解决问题能力，良好的推动力和执行力，能够指导他人从事机器人运动控制算法开发工作，能够指导他人分析解决机器人产品复杂系统问题；\r\n6.技术知识面广，熟练掌握机器人运动学、动力学、运动控制算法、运动规划算法、系统辨识、信号处理、控制理论知识等专业基础知识；","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-02-06T15:48:23","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null}],"Total":0}